WEBVTT

01:46.356 --> 01:48.441
Jiwoo. Did you hear from your dad?

01:51.861 --> 01:54.531
Yoon Jiwoo.
Did your dad call you?

01:55.281 --> 01:57.951
Hey, brat. I'm asking you a question.

01:58.952 --> 02:00.453
When are you done today?

02:01.246 --> 02:03.414
If your dad calls, answer.

02:03.498 --> 02:06.084
And call me to tell me if he does.

02:15.593 --> 02:18.471
Hey! Tell him to turn himself in
if he calls!

02:19.639 --> 02:20.640
Yeah?

02:23.101 --> 02:25.061
- That kid is such a brat.
- Yup.

02:28.481 --> 02:32.902
YOON JIWOO, JUNKIE, IDIOT
GET LOST, DRUGGIE, PSYCHO BITCH

02:45.874 --> 02:48.168
Wow, she actually came back.

02:48.251 --> 02:52.172
This outcast…
You're an honor roll student now, huh?

02:52.255 --> 02:53.882
So, you're not moving away?

02:53.965 --> 02:55.425
- Cut it out.
- Druggie, transfer.

02:55.508 --> 02:57.260
You know, her daddy
could have obliterated you.

02:57.343 --> 02:59.846
Oh, that's bullshit.
There are cops everywhere.

02:59.929 --> 03:02.849
Her junkie dad
is probably dead somewhere, huh?

03:10.815 --> 03:12.108
I did well that time.

03:12.192 --> 03:13.234
Whatever.

03:13.318 --> 03:14.235
Hurry up.

03:14.319 --> 03:15.278
Let's try again.

03:17.864 --> 03:19.490
- Run for it! Sorry!
- My bad!

03:19.574 --> 03:20.783
Oh, over here!

03:20.867 --> 03:22.744
Man, she's fucking annoying.

03:24.162 --> 03:26.497
What? You fucker?

03:26.581 --> 03:29.000
- What? What's your problem?
- Hold on.

03:29.083 --> 03:31.294
The damn junkie is annoying.

03:34.047 --> 03:35.882
- Oh, shit.
- There we go.

03:43.806 --> 03:46.851
Okay, so, the school
is transferring you out.

03:47.435 --> 03:49.520
I'll prepare
all the necessary forms, so--

03:49.604 --> 03:50.980
Why should I transfer?

03:52.232 --> 03:55.151
Do you wanna keep
making people uncomfortable, Jiwoo?

03:56.778 --> 03:59.614
Do you know how many calls I got
from disgruntled parents?

04:04.244 --> 04:06.579
You still can't get
a hold of your dad?

04:08.164 --> 04:12.543
HAPPY 17TH BIRTHDAY
YOON DONGHOON SENT YOU A CAKE

04:16.923 --> 04:18.299
Hey. Give me that.

04:18.383 --> 04:20.385
Go away.

04:20.468 --> 04:23.888
- Oh, no. You want it?
- Oh, poor baby, did it hurt?

04:23.972 --> 04:25.848
Loser.

04:25.932 --> 04:26.975
So cute.

04:27.058 --> 04:28.351
- What a loser.
- Hey.

04:28.434 --> 04:30.228
Give me my phone.

04:32.897 --> 04:33.982
Oh, my god!

04:34.065 --> 04:35.900
Jeez, drugs on her. Call the cops.

04:35.984 --> 04:37.902
- Oh, my god.
- How could you bring drugs to school?

04:37.986 --> 04:40.113
- I'm such a gangster.
- Hey, stop. Back off.

04:41.155 --> 04:44.200
Oh, my. You thought it was okay
to bring drugs here?

04:44.284 --> 04:46.160
You bitch.

04:46.244 --> 04:47.370
What?

04:47.453 --> 04:48.579
What, fucker? Oh!

04:48.663 --> 04:50.331
What's she doing?

04:50.415 --> 04:52.500
- Did she lose her mind?
- Are you kidding me?

04:53.251 --> 04:55.962
Shit. Are you insane?

04:56.462 --> 04:59.048
- Are you fucking crazy?
- What's she doing?

04:59.132 --> 05:00.049
You fucking…

05:03.845 --> 05:05.680
Oh, shit.

05:05.763 --> 05:07.015
Are you fucking crazy?

05:07.098 --> 05:08.182
You crazy bitch.

05:09.726 --> 05:11.269
Get over here, you bitch!

05:14.564 --> 05:15.773
Hey!

05:15.857 --> 05:18.026
You crazy bitch. Let her go!

05:54.937 --> 05:56.105
Leave me alone!

06:00.526 --> 06:02.862
You should expect that
from a gangster's daughter.

06:10.953 --> 06:11.788
Yoon Jiwoo!

06:13.498 --> 06:15.708
She's so crazy…

06:15.792 --> 06:17.543
SHIN YOUNG GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL
YOON JIWOO

06:17.627 --> 06:19.128
I'll withdraw.

06:24.175 --> 06:26.719
SHIN YOUNG GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

06:29.222 --> 06:31.307
Kim Geonyeong,
that punk did…

06:31.391 --> 06:32.850
Hey!

06:32.934 --> 06:35.144
- Hey, what… Hold on.
- What the hell that…

06:35.228 --> 06:37.230
Hey! You brat!

06:37.313 --> 06:39.399
Hey, the hell! What's your problem?

06:39.482 --> 06:41.234
Jiwoo. Hey!

06:41.317 --> 06:42.276
Stop right there!

06:42.360 --> 06:43.778
Hey, damn it!

06:45.071 --> 06:48.157
- Hey! Jiwoo! You little…
- Shit.

06:50.243 --> 06:52.370
You're dead
once I catch you.

06:52.453 --> 06:53.413
Hey!

06:53.996 --> 06:55.123
You little…

06:56.666 --> 06:58.292
Where are you going?

07:00.044 --> 07:01.087
Hey!

07:01.629 --> 07:03.714
Jiwoo!

07:33.202 --> 07:35.913
PHOTOS

08:01.772 --> 08:04.025
Hey, Jiwoo,
were you with your dad?

08:04.775 --> 08:06.486
- So?
- Answer us.

08:07.111 --> 08:08.946
- You brat. Hey!
- Ah… Come on.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.364
- Are you a thug?
- Come on, man.

09:23.813 --> 09:27.275
Jiwoo, it's Dad.

09:27.358 --> 09:29.610
Why weren't you answering your phone?

09:30.111 --> 09:34.448
Happy birthday, my dear daughter.

09:35.324 --> 09:38.119
Sorry, Dad can't even cook you
a birthday dinner.

09:39.161 --> 09:42.081
Did you get the gift I sent you?

09:42.164 --> 09:44.542
The iPad. Yeah.

09:44.625 --> 09:46.085
It's expensive.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.130
Hello?

09:50.339 --> 09:52.258
How was your day, huh?

09:52.800 --> 09:55.511
So did you go singing
with your friends again?

09:58.472 --> 09:59.807
Jiwoo. Jiwoo.

10:00.474 --> 10:01.434
Hello?

10:01.517 --> 10:04.645
The police looking for you,
keep following me around.

10:05.730 --> 10:09.108
They say I'm a gangster's daughter,
so no one talks to me at school.

10:09.191 --> 10:12.194
TOP MOST WANTED FUGITIVES

10:13.779 --> 10:14.989
What you…

10:17.158 --> 10:18.993
What is this about?

10:19.076 --> 10:20.161
Hey, you…

10:21.412 --> 10:23.664
You should have told me about this.

10:23.748 --> 10:24.749
What do you mean?

10:24.832 --> 10:27.168
Your phone's always off.
And you never tell me where you are!

10:28.210 --> 10:30.296
What did you do this time?

10:30.379 --> 10:32.465
Why do you keep doing this?

10:32.548 --> 10:35.551
That's not it. No, you're wrong.

10:37.136 --> 10:38.095
Jiwoo.

10:40.306 --> 10:43.601
I'll settle everything
and come back to you, okay?

10:46.479 --> 10:48.606
So please just wait.

10:52.026 --> 10:53.569
I won't wait anymore.

10:56.530 --> 10:58.699
Don't come back, you're dead to me now.

11:33.067 --> 11:34.735
Hey. What are you doing?

11:43.202 --> 11:45.454
DO YOU KNOW WHAT I'M GOING THROUGH
BECAUSE OF YOU?

11:45.538 --> 11:48.082
HAVE YOU FORGOTTEN ABOUT ME?
AM I NOT YOUR DAUGHTER?

11:48.165 --> 11:51.419
THE COPS ARE STILL OUTSIDE THE HOUSE
EVERYONE IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD KNOWS

11:51.502 --> 11:53.254
DAD, WHERE ARE YOU…
PLEASE CALL ME

11:58.551 --> 12:00.428
- Taeju.
- Yes?

12:05.099 --> 12:06.100
Get out of here.

12:54.732 --> 12:56.025
Hey.

12:57.109 --> 12:59.236
- Hey. Hey, hey, hey.
- Hmm.

12:59.320 --> 13:00.529
What the heck.

13:00.613 --> 13:02.865
Yo,
cut back on your smoking.

13:02.948 --> 13:05.201
Shit. I'm about to explode.

13:08.871 --> 13:11.040
Shit.
You asshole. No. Damn it.

13:36.982 --> 13:38.734
Jiwoo. It's Dad.

14:14.186 --> 14:15.104
Dad?

14:38.836 --> 14:39.962
Papa.

14:40.045 --> 14:41.463
Dad. Are you okay?

14:41.547 --> 14:43.757
- What's wrong, huh?
- Please…

14:44.341 --> 14:45.718
Not my girl.

14:49.638 --> 14:50.973
Papa!

14:57.897 --> 14:59.982
Papa!

15:00.065 --> 15:01.483
Open up the door, Papa!

15:01.567 --> 15:03.611
Oh, dear.
Don't come out, Jiwoo!

15:03.694 --> 15:05.070
Don't come out!

15:18.375 --> 15:20.628
Papa, are you okay? Open the door.

15:20.711 --> 15:21.754
Please, Papa.

15:21.837 --> 15:23.923
I wanna come to you.

15:24.006 --> 15:25.799
Please let me out.

15:25.883 --> 15:27.343
Please.

15:29.094 --> 15:29.970
Jiwoo.

15:30.054 --> 15:31.847
Huh? Uh… Yeah.

15:33.098 --> 15:34.183
I'm sorry.

15:34.266 --> 15:37.227
I made your life so hard.

15:38.562 --> 15:40.898
No! No, it's okay!

15:40.981 --> 15:43.484
It's okay! Please, open the door.

15:43.567 --> 15:46.278
No, Papa. Open it!

15:46.362 --> 15:48.447
Why did I end up like this?

15:50.074 --> 15:51.742
This is all my fault.

15:51.825 --> 15:53.035
No. It…

15:53.786 --> 15:55.537
It's not, Papa,

15:55.621 --> 15:56.914
it's not your fault.

15:56.997 --> 15:57.998
Jiwoo.

15:58.999 --> 16:01.085
- Yes, Dad.
- My dear Jiwoo.

16:03.629 --> 16:04.880
To me…

16:07.549 --> 16:08.926
you were…

16:24.441 --> 16:25.651
I'm coming.

16:26.568 --> 16:29.321
Hold on, Papa. No, just wait.

16:29.905 --> 16:31.907
No, please!

16:36.370 --> 16:39.498
Papa! No, Papa. Papa!

16:41.542 --> 16:44.211
Papa!

16:48.048 --> 16:49.550
Oh, no!

16:57.474 --> 16:59.435
Papa. Papa!

17:00.060 --> 17:01.687
Papa. Wake up.

17:02.229 --> 17:04.023
Please, wake up!

17:04.898 --> 17:09.611
Papa. Please. Please. Papa. Papa. Please.

17:09.695 --> 17:11.488
Help! Someone help!

17:11.572 --> 17:12.656
Someone help!

17:12.740 --> 17:14.992
Somebody, please help my dad!

17:15.075 --> 17:17.077
Someone. Please, someone…

18:42.079 --> 18:44.123
Are you the leader of the operation?

18:48.043 --> 18:49.878
What did you make my dad do?

18:53.841 --> 18:55.217
Beat people?

18:58.929 --> 19:00.931
Did he threaten and stab them?

19:08.647 --> 19:10.357
Who was it that killed my dad?

19:13.569 --> 19:14.695
Your father…

19:17.281 --> 19:19.783
was my most trusted friend and brother.

19:22.953 --> 19:24.246
And Donghoon…

19:27.624 --> 19:29.042
was a good father.

19:33.839 --> 19:35.132
Remember that.

19:45.559 --> 19:47.728
Here. Please, come closer.

19:49.605 --> 19:51.148
Come closer.

19:52.065 --> 19:54.234
This will be the last time
you're able to see him,

19:54.318 --> 19:58.280
so say goodbye
and wish him peace in the afterlife.

19:58.363 --> 20:00.616
Feel free to hold his hand
and send him off.

20:29.770 --> 20:31.980
What a nice song.

20:32.564 --> 20:33.982
What's it called?

20:34.066 --> 20:35.651
What's wrong with your hand?

20:37.736 --> 20:39.488
It's because I'm a coward.

20:42.991 --> 20:44.284
Papa.

20:44.368 --> 20:45.827
- Hey, you stop.
- Why should I?

20:45.911 --> 20:47.454
Don't be a coward.

20:47.537 --> 20:49.623
Okay. Papa.

20:50.874 --> 20:51.833
What?

20:52.376 --> 20:56.129
If you have the super power
to be able to turn back time…

20:56.213 --> 20:58.423
So, if you could…

20:58.507 --> 21:00.217
- Go back?
- Yes.

21:00.300 --> 21:03.220
If you could go back to when you were 17…

21:06.390 --> 21:07.724
would you do it?

21:12.938 --> 21:13.897
No.

21:16.525 --> 21:17.693
Because, well…

21:18.652 --> 21:20.112
I couldn't be your papa.

21:20.195 --> 21:22.322
Oh, come on.

21:23.824 --> 21:25.242
Jiwoo.

21:25.325 --> 21:28.412
Should we build a house
and live by the sea, huh?

21:28.495 --> 21:30.122
Let's move to Jeju.

21:30.205 --> 21:31.164
No.

21:31.248 --> 21:33.667
We can build a house on the beach,

21:33.750 --> 21:36.378
hang a hammock in the yard,
and have a dog too.

21:36.461 --> 21:37.546
Perfect!

21:37.629 --> 21:39.715
All right. Let's go.

21:39.798 --> 21:41.091
Okay. Hold on, hold on.

21:41.174 --> 21:42.384
When are we going to move?

21:42.467 --> 21:43.343
Soon.

21:45.178 --> 21:47.014
I'm almost done with my job.

21:52.394 --> 21:54.354
Ah, this is nice.

22:24.760 --> 22:27.095
- What is it now?
- What's your problem?

22:28.305 --> 22:29.931
- You drop the case?
- Yeah.

22:30.015 --> 22:32.392
There's no murder weapon or a witness.

22:32.476 --> 22:34.436
We have nothing to go off of.

22:34.519 --> 22:35.937
So that's it then?

22:41.151 --> 22:42.361
What about this asshole?

22:42.944 --> 22:44.279
You have to catch him!

22:44.363 --> 22:46.531
Hey. How can we catch him with this?

22:46.615 --> 22:48.367
You go and catch him then.

22:48.450 --> 22:51.119
Oh, come on, asshole!
A person has been murdered!

22:52.245 --> 22:53.705
Please, stop.

22:56.124 --> 22:57.667
What did you say to your dad?

22:58.502 --> 23:00.212
You're the one who spoke to him last.

23:04.132 --> 23:06.093
He was on the most wanted list

23:06.176 --> 23:08.136
and had been in hiding for three months.

23:08.220 --> 23:09.096
TOP MOST WANTED FUGITIVES

23:09.179 --> 23:11.348
What did you say to make him come home?

23:13.725 --> 23:15.435
I won't wait anymore.

23:18.313 --> 23:20.565
Don't come back, you're dead to me now.

23:23.360 --> 23:25.112
He should have turned himself in.

23:25.195 --> 23:27.155
Then he wouldn't have died pointlessly.

23:30.409 --> 23:31.576
Keep it down.

23:31.660 --> 23:32.661
You assholes!

23:32.744 --> 23:33.870
Stop it!

23:33.954 --> 23:36.206
Stop. Stop it. Stop.

23:36.289 --> 23:39.376
Hey! Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Hey, hey, stop! Hey, hey, hey!

23:49.010 --> 23:50.595
You need to take a look at this.

25:23.939 --> 25:25.565
CCTV INVESTIGATION

25:26.274 --> 25:28.401
Please help me find my dad's killer.

25:31.279 --> 25:33.990
You said he was your trusted friend
and brother.

25:35.325 --> 25:36.576
If I find him?

25:38.119 --> 25:39.621
Then I will kill him.

25:45.585 --> 25:47.003
You'll kill him…

25:56.680 --> 25:58.890
Do you know what it is like
to kill someone?

26:14.322 --> 26:15.323
Stab me.

26:19.536 --> 26:22.205
Pretend that I'm the killer and stab me.

26:25.667 --> 26:27.335
Do it.

26:28.253 --> 26:29.087
Do it.

26:31.464 --> 26:33.049
Do it!

26:53.945 --> 26:55.155
Drag her out.

29:32.270 --> 29:33.354
LOOKING FOR WITNESSES

30:12.685 --> 30:15.522
Oh. Want some drugs? Hey.

30:16.147 --> 30:17.398
I'll help you out.

30:33.456 --> 30:36.125
LOOKING FOR WITNESSES
REWARD: 5 MILLION WON

30:56.354 --> 31:00.567
You always pay so much
for cigarettes. Thank you.

31:06.698 --> 31:09.701
LOOKING FOR WITNESSES
REWARD: 5 MILLION WON

31:29.178 --> 31:32.307
UNKNOWN NUMBER

31:34.434 --> 31:36.144
I know this asshole.

31:36.227 --> 31:37.645
Bring in the money.

31:37.729 --> 31:39.355
I'll text you the location.

32:25.401 --> 32:26.402
Hey!

32:28.988 --> 32:30.365
You came on time.

32:30.448 --> 32:31.616
Who is that guy?

32:31.699 --> 32:34.369
Show me the money and I'll talk.

32:34.452 --> 32:36.162
Give us the cash first.

32:49.467 --> 32:50.843
So, who is he?

32:56.557 --> 32:59.686
That asshole… his initials are G.R.

33:00.770 --> 33:04.399
The Grim Reaper.

33:05.358 --> 33:07.735
He's like the grim reaper
here to kill you.

33:08.319 --> 33:09.445
Hey!

33:09.529 --> 33:11.656
Move!

33:11.739 --> 33:13.574
- Hey, it's really five million won.
- Shit.

33:13.658 --> 33:14.701
- Hey.
- Whoa.

33:14.784 --> 33:17.495
We kill people for one million won.

33:17.578 --> 33:21.249
For five million, we can stuff you
and preserve certain body parts.

33:21.332 --> 33:23.334
- Oh, wow!
- Damn!

33:23.418 --> 33:24.335
Do you like that?

33:26.045 --> 33:27.797
You're not going anywhere!

33:31.718 --> 33:33.177
Kill him! Fuck!

33:33.261 --> 33:34.804
Step aside.

33:43.104 --> 33:44.897
What, she's a girl.

33:44.981 --> 33:46.399
- Shit.
- Wow, look!

33:46.983 --> 33:48.109
She's pretty.

33:48.192 --> 33:49.986
Whoa.

33:50.069 --> 33:52.363
Hey!

33:52.447 --> 33:53.906
Shit!

33:57.201 --> 33:58.703
Kill her! Damn it!

34:01.998 --> 34:02.874
- Bitch!
- Wait.

34:02.957 --> 34:04.292
Hey!

34:04.375 --> 34:06.085
Don't kick her in the face.

34:35.948 --> 34:38.326
- Hey!
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Whoa.

34:39.952 --> 34:42.205
For god's sake.
Don't you know how to drive?

34:42.288 --> 34:43.456
- Hey, hey, hey.
- Uh, shit.

34:43.539 --> 34:45.083
Hey, pretend you're hurt.

34:46.125 --> 34:48.252
- Fucking dude. Bastard.
- Shut up.

34:49.670 --> 34:51.130
Yo!

34:51.214 --> 34:54.008
Shit driver!
Threatened for a fight?

34:54.634 --> 34:55.593
Fuck!

34:57.095 --> 34:58.554
What'd you hit me for?

34:58.638 --> 34:59.931
Asshole!

35:01.307 --> 35:03.643
What are you doing, dumbass?

35:03.726 --> 35:04.727
Fuck!

36:03.411 --> 36:06.372
If you wanna die,
there are better ways to do it.

36:11.752 --> 36:13.963
It's none of your business, mister.

36:22.930 --> 36:25.099
So? Did you catch my dad's killer?

36:29.395 --> 36:30.396
I guess not.

36:31.480 --> 36:33.316
Stop acting out and stay low

36:33.941 --> 36:35.651
or you'll die on the street.

36:39.030 --> 36:40.573
How can I stay low?

36:42.909 --> 36:45.912
The cops won't investigate,
and you won't do anything!

36:46.871 --> 36:48.122
So how…

36:50.374 --> 36:52.877
How can I live like nothing's wronged?

37:00.176 --> 37:02.220
When all of this is my fault.

37:13.022 --> 37:15.483
Do you have to get revenge?

37:17.568 --> 37:19.445
Regardless of the price you pay?

37:27.078 --> 37:28.704
I will handle all of it.

37:37.046 --> 37:39.840
If you're determined
to catch and kill this man…

37:43.511 --> 37:46.055
you need to be capable of killing someone.

38:25.511 --> 38:28.514
SEONJIN SHIPPING

38:45.197 --> 38:46.157
Sir.

38:46.240 --> 38:47.325
Sir.

38:53.331 --> 38:54.582
Hello, sir.

38:57.501 --> 38:58.377
Hello, sir.

39:01.464 --> 39:02.298
Our new member.

39:03.883 --> 39:05.092
Say hello.

39:18.898 --> 39:20.316
Who the hell is she?

39:22.610 --> 39:23.944
Maybe she's a snack?

39:24.570 --> 39:26.405
For us to eat when we're bored?

39:26.489 --> 39:28.199
Hey. She's a little girl.

39:28.282 --> 39:30.951
Exactly. So we'll
raise her well, then we'll eat her.

39:31.660 --> 39:34.205
He said she's a new member,
not a snack.

39:34.288 --> 39:35.539
Okay, asshole.

39:38.667 --> 39:41.087
Crazy bastard.

39:41.170 --> 39:42.129
Hey, kid.

39:44.882 --> 39:46.008
Come along.

39:50.304 --> 39:51.347
Hey!

40:03.067 --> 40:04.151
Tell me…

40:05.236 --> 40:06.862
What do you plan to do with her?

40:09.573 --> 40:11.117
She wants to get revenge.

40:15.955 --> 40:16.997
Let her.

40:25.214 --> 40:26.841
You can sleep here.

40:34.473 --> 40:37.518
From now on, cleaning, laundry,
and the dishes

40:37.601 --> 40:38.894
are your job, okay?

40:40.438 --> 40:41.981
Finally, get to live upstairs.

40:42.648 --> 40:44.024
I was the youngest until you.

40:45.818 --> 40:46.861
Two years.

40:51.699 --> 40:54.952
Once you prove yourself,
you can move up there.

40:55.870 --> 40:58.205
You really become part
of the organization.

40:59.748 --> 41:01.167
I'm going up there.

41:01.250 --> 41:02.918
I'll make it to the top.

41:11.594 --> 41:12.845
Why are you here?

41:14.013 --> 41:14.889
You're a girl.

41:15.681 --> 41:17.057
To get stronger.

41:23.230 --> 41:24.231
Right.

41:26.233 --> 41:27.234
I wish you luck.

41:44.543 --> 41:48.297
DECEASED, YOON DONGHOON

41:51.800 --> 41:53.093
Don't worry.

41:58.390 --> 41:59.725
I'll be fine.

42:23.332 --> 42:24.959
Come on. Let's go, let's go!

42:33.175 --> 42:35.302
Hey, newbie!

42:36.679 --> 42:38.180
Hey!

42:39.431 --> 42:43.561
Whoa!

42:46.021 --> 42:46.897
Yeah! Yeah!

42:53.028 --> 42:55.072
What's that look for, you fucking bitch?

42:56.782 --> 42:58.534
Come on, give me some ass.

43:00.327 --> 43:01.203
Yeah!

43:01.287 --> 43:03.247
Hey. You're the prettiest one here.

43:04.832 --> 43:06.834
You're absolutely
the fucking prettiest!

43:06.917 --> 43:08.377
A man is declaring
his love for you--

43:08.460 --> 43:09.461
You…

43:12.298 --> 43:13.424
Fuck your clothes.

43:48.542 --> 43:51.503
Well, that's annoying.

43:53.213 --> 43:54.131
Are you okay?

43:54.214 --> 43:55.257
Damn!

43:56.050 --> 43:57.468
Oh, how cute.

43:57.551 --> 43:58.636
A cup?

43:59.803 --> 44:01.847
Oh, look at the fire in your eyes.

44:01.930 --> 44:04.350
You wanna fight, huh? Let's go.

44:04.433 --> 44:05.726
Fucker!

44:06.894 --> 44:08.520
You fucking bitch.

44:08.604 --> 44:10.898
Oh, shit!

44:10.981 --> 44:13.275
Give me some ass.

44:14.526 --> 44:15.861
Fucking bitch.

44:15.944 --> 44:17.863
- Hey. Stop it.
- Hey!

44:17.946 --> 44:20.866
If you're not gonna give us ass,
why are you here, you bitch?

44:20.949 --> 44:23.619
Hey, hey, that bitch hit me first.
Let go of me!

44:23.702 --> 44:24.870
Get off!

45:12.084 --> 45:13.627
You gonna run away?

45:14.962 --> 45:16.338
No, I'm going to win.

45:20.217 --> 45:21.385
Exactly.

45:23.512 --> 45:24.888
You can't win like that.

45:30.310 --> 45:31.687
It's not "winning"…

45:33.814 --> 45:34.940
but "killing".

45:36.984 --> 45:38.193
"I'll kill him."

45:41.280 --> 45:43.031
That's how you need to fight.

45:44.450 --> 45:46.243
Don't compete with strength.

45:46.326 --> 45:48.746
Regardless of training, you'll lose.

45:48.829 --> 45:50.080
And what do I do?

45:56.837 --> 45:58.172
Attack the vitals.

46:01.967 --> 46:06.555
The temple, upper lip, chin, solar plexus,

46:07.222 --> 46:09.349
and genitals.

46:13.896 --> 46:15.647
If you hit only the vitals…

46:17.232 --> 46:19.359
then you can take down your opponent.

46:23.864 --> 46:24.782
Okay.

46:26.116 --> 46:27.075
Let's try it.

46:27.159 --> 46:29.536
Huh?

46:30.245 --> 46:31.163
Come here.

47:08.534 --> 47:09.535
Upper lip.

47:14.790 --> 47:15.833
Harder!

47:15.916 --> 47:16.959
Chin.

47:18.669 --> 47:19.711
Then guard.

47:37.062 --> 47:38.689
Are you okay?

47:39.690 --> 47:41.024
That was a good hit.

47:41.859 --> 47:44.653
You've got talent, but not enough power.

47:45.237 --> 47:46.238
Again.

49:16.036 --> 49:16.912
DO NOT ENTER

49:16.995 --> 49:17.829
SEONJIN SHIPPING

49:17.913 --> 49:19.915
We protect the organization!

49:21.041 --> 49:23.669
The organization protects us all.

49:23.752 --> 49:26.046
Dongcheon! Dongcheon!

50:54.134 --> 50:55.302
Gangjae wins!

50:56.303 --> 51:00.015
And your reward, a week off
and ten million won.

51:07.064 --> 51:09.232
Do Gangjae! Do Gangjae!

51:09.316 --> 51:11.318
Rookie's still standing though.
